# Nous gateway providers & Telegram secrets for Hermes Gateway.
# `deploy.sh prod` copies this to gitignored `docker/env/.env.gateway`.
# `hermes-agent` does NOT load this file — only `hermes-gateway` does.
#
# IMPORTANT: Uncomment a line ONLY after you have a real value.
# For OPENROUTER_API_KEY, NVIDIA_API_KEY, GOOGLE_API_KEY, and COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN,
# an empty Compose interpolation passes "" and hides /opt/data/.env.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Model Providers (Active Today)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OpenRouter (everyday Gemini Flash / multi-model routing)
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# NVIDIA NIM (free fallback & background context compression via build.nvidia.com)
# NVIDIA_API_KEY=

# Google AI Studio (Gemini API key today; starts with AQ. or AIza...)
# Note: Consumer Gemini subscriptions are NOT yet supported via OAuth in Hermes.
# Nous Research + Google are building official approved Gemini Subscription OAuth
# (not live yet, no date). Until then, use GOOGLE_API_KEY/GEMINI_API_KEY or OpenRouter.
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# GitHub Copilot (optional hard-turn model via fine-grained github_pat_ / gho_ / ghu_)
# COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN=
# GITHUB_COPILOT_TOKEN=

# Optional API keys for Anthropic / OpenAI / Nous Portal:
# (For Claude Pro/Max or ChatGPT Plus/Pro OAuth subscriptions, run `hermes model`
#  or `hermes setup --portal` inside `hermes-gateway` — tokens persist in /opt/data/auth.json.)
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# NOUS_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Telegram Personal Assistant Gateway
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Create a bot via @BotFather -> /newbot, and get your numeric user ID via @userinfobot.
# Leaving these commented out preserves values written interactively by `hermes gateway setup`
# inside /opt/data/.env.
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
# TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_USERS=
# TELEGRAM_HOME_CHANNEL=
# TELEGRAM_GROUP_ALLOWED_USERS=
# TELEGRAM_GROUP_ALLOWED_CHATS=
